"weight:600;\">Idle Scheduling</span></p>\n"
"<p style=\" margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-"
"right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;\">កម្មវិធី​ដែល​កំពុង​រត់​ជាមួយ​អាទិភាព I/"
